# Everything here is produced by a run. `SeedLanding` writes the landing
# CSVs so the example needs no setup and works from any working
# directory; the three layers are derived from them.
#
# They land relative to the *current* directory, not this one — `aro run`
# does not chdir into the application — so running from the repository
# root leaves them there instead. That is what the integration runner
# does, and why the example seeds its own input rather than shipping it.
landing/
bronze/
silver/
gold/
MedallionPipeline
